ons":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T12:31:31-07:00","id":1113317,"title":"","content":"It's possible it's a term for a new thing in second edition I suppose. Since Manifestations are now Haunts and Haunts are now Cenotes. I recall reading that Thresholds are going to be different sort of thing now, but retained in some sort of way, so it's possible archetypes might also be getting changed. Though I think we're going to need confirmation from Travis or some other writer on the book to be sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T08:17:07-07:00","id":1113740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1112937-reapers-new-anatongists?p=1112999#post1112999\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Boy that's gonna get confusing.<br /> <br /> Reaper Sin-Eater: Hey guys, I'm new in town, I was wondering-<br /> <br /> Other SE: AAAAH! RUN AWAY!<br /> <br /> <br /> RSE: Huh? I mean, I'm the Voodoo Punisher and all, but I'm not that terrifying outside my cost-<br /> <br /> OSE: GET THE WOMEN AND CHILDREN! MAYBE IT'LL GO FOR THEM FIRST!<br /> <br /> And so, the prophecy becomes self-fulfilling.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> currently just literally finished rolling on the floor laughing at that last line","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-27T12:38:49-08:00","id":1189979,"title":"","content":"While this is old, and it\u2019s more than likely that Reapers are simply Geister or Cthonians loyal to the Cthonic Gods who collect living souls and Ghosts for the Underworld... my personal prediction is that a Reaper is one of the Bound who made the Bargain with a Cthonian instead of a Geist, And is little more than a slave with a tiny bit of autonomy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-27T12:42:15-08:00","id":1189980,"title":"","content":"Ghost hosts!<br /> <br /> Either way I'm looking forward to reading about them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-27T14:07:47-08:00","id":1190001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1112937-reapers-new-anatongists?p=1189979#post1189979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">my personal prediction is that a Reaper is one of the Bound who made the Bargain with a Cthonian instead of a Geist, And is little more than a slave with a tiny bit of autonomy</div> </div> </div> </div>I really doubt it would be the case, as Chthonian Bound was mentioned a number of time as a Night Horrors material that won't show up in the core book (not to mention that the first Bound were created through a Bargain with a Chthonian, which makes me to doubt their would be mindless slaves. From what it seems, they are the outcome of ghosts becoming the emissaries of the Chthonic Gods- but we would know soon enough, hopefully.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-28T20:11:36-08:00","id":1190540,"title":"","content":"From what I recall, the developers said to beware ghosts in masks. I'm guessing those are Reapers, and they wear those masks to show allegiance to the Chthonic God who they have sworn fealty to.<br /> <br /> In much the same way a nun is married to God, the Reapers do it to themselves. When the Underworld is good to you, you naturally serve its mythological rulers, and grow quite upset when the word &quot;reform&quot; is bandied about...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-28T20:45:54-08:00","id":1190545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1112937-reapers-new-anatongists?p=1190540#post1190540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I recall, the developers said to beware ghosts in masks. I'm guessing those are Reapers, and they wear those masks to show allegiance to the Chthonic God who they have sworn fealty to.<br /> <br /> In much the same way a nun is married to God, the Reapers do it to themselves. When the Underworld is good to you, you naturally serve its mythological rulers, and grow quite upset when the word &quot;reform&quot; is bandied about...</div> </div> </div> </div>Or that Deathmasks are Mementos left from Geists. Maybe Reapers are ghosts that are killing Geists...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-01T01:31:21-08:00","id":1190597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1112937-reapers-new-anatongists?p=1190540#post1190540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In much the same way a nun is married to God, the Reapers do it to themselves. When the Underworld is good to you, you naturally serve its mythological rulers, and grow quite upset when the word &quot;reform&quot; is bandied about...</div> </div> </div> </div> Not to mention that when asked, Travis said that the &quot;dirty, lowly, earthly things which clings to the living world like parasites&quot; connotation to the Chthonic Gods is intentional for the choice of the name, and that the Underworld has been described as something dark and malicious which intentionally devours the dead and haunt the living, making the choice of siding with the dread lords of a dread kingdom may sounds much better than becoming its victim. A price may be needed, of course, but always consider the alternative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4